{
  "id": 20,
  "name": "frontloaded_return_v2",
  "intent": "Front-load return_distance via sqrt(progress) ramp (0.2→0.65) so origin-relative positioning guides picks from the start—addressing uniform instances where the origin is the main global landmark and local distances collapse to ties. Strengthen early regret (0.15 base vs parent's 0.1) so the 'how uniquely positioned' signal helps break ties when local structure is weak, while keeping late regret at 0.35 for must-take picks before the closing leg dominates. The sqrt ramp front-loads return while still delivering a strong late boost.",
  "tags": [
    "return_aware",
    "regret"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    rw = 0.2 + 0.45 * sqrt(f[\"progress\"])\n    rgw = 0.15 + 0.2 * f[\"progress\"]\n    return -f[\"distance\"] + rw * f[\"return_distance\"] + rgw * f[\"regret\"] + 0.05 * f[\"nearest_remaining\"]",
